{"5091450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yeetbags", "steam_appid": 5091450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete, sabotage and mess with your friends by launching superpowered bags down the range to score massive points. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase your favourite loadout, or try something new from the Yeetbag vending machines before you all head into the range to YEET...YOUR...BAGS! Aim for the the centre of the target for the biggest points, or use special bags to mess with your friends and make them hate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEVASTATING YEETING SYNERGIES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match Yeetbags to find the perfect winning strategy. block your friends shots with massive walls, cover the target with slippery, soapy foam or suck in the competition with galactic black-holes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YEETING SABOTAGE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything in the range can be used to mess with your friends. Pick up a burger and yeet it at others to block their vision right before a critical shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BAGS WITH PERSONALITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bag is alive and full to the brim with delightfully unhinged personalities. They bring the range to life with quippy, witty banter!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete, sabotage and mess with your friends by launching superpowered bags down the range to score massive points. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase your favourite loadout, or try something new from the Yeetbag vending machines before you all head into the range to YEET...YOUR...BAGS! Aim for the the centre of the target for the biggest points, or use special bags to mess with your friends and make them hate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEVASTATING YEETING SYNERGIES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match Yeetbags to find the perfect winning strategy. block your friends shots with massive walls, cover the target with slippery, soapy foam or suck in the competition with galactic black-holes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YEETING SABOTAGE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything in the range can be used to mess with your friends. Pick up a burger and yeet it at others to block their vision right before a critical shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BAGS WITH PERSONALITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every bag is alive and full to the brim with delightfully unhinged personalities. They bring the range to life with quippy, witty banter!</p>", "short_description": "Compete and sabotage your friends with superpowered bags with unhinged personalities in this ultimate bag-tossing, multiplayer showdown. YEET. THOSE. BAGS!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091450/610b381c91221ecfc39f662104fa52a42a8551b5/header.jpg?t=1787954951", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091450/6b00d018ada83bd1112e708c3877f46991935ffd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787954951", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5091450/6b00d018ada83bd1112e708c3877f46991935ffd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787954951", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBC</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBC</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "©2026 Radical Forge Ltd. Published by Rad